{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37274","headline":"陈宫 · 秦韬玉","name":"陈宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临春高阁拟瀛洲，贪宠张妃作胜游。\n便把江山爲己有，岂知台榭是身讐。\n金城暗逐歌声碎，铁瓮潜随舞势休。\n谁识古宫堪恨处，井桐吟雨不胜秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37274.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37274","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}